TITLE Albite kinetics in pH 2 at 200C with Fe2/Fe3 and fixed P H2S(g)

SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Fe(+3) 4
    Fe(+2) 4

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5

KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
    -steps 10 in 1000

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -ionic_strength true

END
